/* ==================== Script 330 id="amiyo-gs02-keypresets" ==================== */
/* GREEN SCREEN Step 2 of 10: ULTRA KEY PRESETS + OUTPUT VIEWS.
   Chroma Key (Inspector) now starts with "Key strength" presets - Relaxed (soft, natural edges, for clean even screens), Balanced (a good start),
   Aggressive (removes more green, for wrinkled or unevenly lit screens) - one tap sets Tolerance, Edge feather, Edge shrink, Edge blur and
   spill clean-up (your key colour and background are kept). "Output view" works like Premiere's: Composite (the finished picture),
   Alpha (black = removed, white = kept, grey = see-through) and Status (black = removed, white = kept, PINK = half-removed edge pixels that need
   attention). Alpha and Status are only for checking, they are never exported. Undo works. Old projects are unchanged. */
