/* ==================== Script 356 id="amiyo-step166-fxfold" ==================== */
/* Step 7 (build plan 2): Faster preview with many effects. Every frame the editor builds one filter string from all of a clip's effects and the phone's
   picture engine runs each item in it. Stacked effects of the same kind (several brightness, contrast, saturation, hue or blur items next to each other)
   are now merged into one item with the same result (brightness, contrast and saturation multiply, hue angles add, blurs combine as the square root of the
   sum of squares). The merged text is remembered, so an unchanged stack costs nothing to rebuild. Mixed kinds, grayscale, sepia, invert and any custom filter are left exactly as they were. */
