/* ==================== Script 357 id="amiyo-step167-offlinefonts" ==================== */
/* Step 8 (build plan 2): Offline font fallback. The editor's look uses three web fonts from Google. Offline (or on a bad connection) the page still showed correctly
   through system fonts, but it kept trying the network and waiting for fonts that were never coming. Now: if the phone is offline at start, the font requests are skipped
   and the built-in system fonts are used straight away; if the fonts have not arrived after 8 seconds, the same happens; when the connection returns the fonts load by themselves.
   Waiting for a font (text clips, Title styles) gives up after 3 seconds instead of hanging. Help shows which fonts are in use. */
