/* ==================== Script 361 id="amiyo-step171-menufit" ==================== */
/* Step 171: the track menu is positioned when it opens, but other add-ons append items to it afterwards, and with 44 px items it could run off the bottom of the phone.
   Re-fit it (move up, and scroll inside it if it is still too tall) whenever it opens or gains items. */
